ttps://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293690_1686151675834132_8698031608934507191_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sceWeVleto0Q7kNvwGl-iX4&_nc_oc=Adr6HCVGVphGrQYwLfoQwAv90e9E07o9rUinRpbnwdAp2eX2rcXPBzmJ0r-1aFrzah0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPjd9Systl3Eqvn7-0FfZZ6vyDrETVMrVxhnitA_ZQs2w&oe=6AE20D78"}, {"file_name": "GRE_shot_09.png", "id": "1055816933500576", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292232_1055816936833909_3000101644956586739_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8Pioubd8CxgQ7kNvwHsWpIw&_nc_oc=AdoP530bfs94Eewi-6VBqY-mseUkHqfhBrtXWzyK14NAxhIYiRaZ0ir-RZzVil3Dm_c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPTzWp3KFa4B4Zpqs93a-qNen0Jd2jvTAAfhvVXvbAaqA&oe=6AE1F230"}, {"file_name": "GRE_shot_07.png", "id": "823585367388767", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296157_823585370722100_7495270603048586221_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KX_UqX1YFEQQ7kNvwET0La9&_nc_oc=Adp8uwscRC_YWg9ydpUFmrFu8BHhy83x60kMmlwpfS6XtsqFw0bYDmgMOPhMp-qYMqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNKTTZU5E-9dmSWahWY_ONe4oVBYtYJmzoMrUv9ForxFQ&oe=6AE1EF89"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "universal_basic_asset_2560x1440.png", "id": "1591462789162575", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298387_1591462792495908_4857866229976880023_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H9OdAc3oAewQ7kNvwE70MAF&_nc_oc=AdppEiHtLVjiMc3_ETLbFo0qwP3TpaXJJtrEtDKRw2YjXM1HB4ed-UQH7Rbe83OzjKI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQONHZ7ChEqmW104TLyEyZLaPiQwgL_XI0Ld4L0r96hWTg&oe=6AE2039D"}, "display_name": "Goal Rush Eleven", "keywords": ["soccer", "futbol", "futball", "sports"], "long_description": "You don't watch the match. You play it.\n\nGOAL RUSH ELEVEN puts you ON the pitch in virtual reality. This isn't another kick-the-ball-from-a-fixed-spot simulator: you are a real player on the field. You sprint with your own arms, turn to find space, hear the stadium roar behind you, and when the ball reaches your feet, the goal is on you and nobody else.\n\nUnder the hood is a full match engine \u2014real AI, tactics and physics\u2014 brought to first person on Meta Quest for the first time. Your teammates make runs, the defense cuts off your pass, the keeper reads you. You feel the match instead of watching it.\n\nAnd when things heat up, something no other football game has ever let you do: let the fouls pile up and the brawl breaks out. You drop the ball and fight with your own fists, your team against theirs, until the ref hands out cards and play resumes. As ridiculous and as fun as it sounds. You won't find it anywhere else.\n\nEvery match lives in a world of its own: different stadiums, rain, snow, fog or sunshine, day and night, crowds singing real chants, and commentary that raises the hair on your arms. No two matches feel the same.\n\nAnd it all counts. Earn Bal\u00f3n Coins by playing, place your bet before you walk out, and climb from the street pitches to the big stadiums. No wires, no excuses: just you, the ball and ninety minutes.\n\nPull on the gloves or lace up the boots. The pitch is waiting.", "short_description": "ou don't watch the match. You play it.\n\nGOAL RUSH ELEVEN puts you ON the pitch in VR: sprint with your own arms, turn into space, and when the ball reaches your feet, the goal is on you. A real match engine \u2014AI, tactics and physics\u2014 in first person on Meta Quest.\n\nMatch heating up? The brawl breaks out: drop the ball and swing your own fists until the cards come out.\n\nStadiums, rain, snow, crowds singing. Earn Bal\u00f3n Coins every match.\n\nGet on the pitch.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.claude.ai/code/artifact/685fb9e0-5e0c-4464-adf7-6bb0baadad7d", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "pu